    "No gross profit is reported; cogs = 'Compute and infrastructure' (includes model-training compute, so it overstates a cost of revenue).",
    "EBIT = GAAP operating income (loss): includes stock-based compensation, non-cash donation-matching charges, and the one-off $1.5B Bartz settlement (Q3 2025, so it drops out of LTM Sep-2026).",
